# Every text file is LF in the working tree too: configs, SQL and scripts are read inside Linux
# containers, and the CI checks compare exact bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Shell scripts, SQL and configs are read inside Linux containers: keep LF on every checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.d2 text eol=lf
# Rendered diagrams: keep the bytes D2 writes (no EOL conversion, so make diagrams-check compares
# exactly what CI renders) and collapse them in PR diffs; review the .d2 source instead.
*.svg -text
docs/diagrams/*.svg linguist-generated=true
